# Writing

Import Layout.

## Page /writing

Head:
    <title>Writing — Acme</title>
    <meta name="description" content="Notes on tools, shipping and doing less.">

State:
    Let posts be ["On doing less", "Shipping is a habit", "Tools that vanish"].

View:
    {extends Site}
    {block content:}
      <h1>Writing</h1>
      <ul class="posts">
        {for each post in posts:}<li>{post}</li>{end}
      </ul>
    {end}

## Test: the writing index lists every post and marks Writing active

Expect that the count of ".posts li" is equal to 3.
Expect that the text of ".posts li" is equal to "On doing less".
Expect that the count of "nav a" is equal to 4.
Expect that the count of "nav a.active" is equal to 1.
Expect that the text of "nav a.active" is equal to "Writing".
